                        </span>
                        <div class="flex items-center -mt-1 pl-1 gap-2">
                            <span class="text-[9px] md:text-[10px] tracking-[0.4em] md:tracking-[0.5em] uppercase text-white/80 font-light">
                                Fashion
                            </span>
                            <span class="h-[1px] flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-gold/40 to-transparent"></span>
